{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An 8-bit styled platform game.\u00a0 Running and Jumping sidescrolling, lots of powerups in an 8-bit world.\u00a0 30 levels with hidden items to collect.\u00a0 Each level has 3 hidden items to collect, a hoagie, a soda, and a French fries.\u00a0 There is also a magic door that leads to a secret room with coins.\u00a0 Collect each on every level to unlock the brickball game.\u00a0 Collect coins to buy power ups, like the wizard hat, turning you into a wizard that can float and shoot freezing ice that turns enemies into snowballs you can throw, or get the hammer and throw hammers at enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the keyboard or gamepad compatible .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:\u00a0 After defeating his boss and his evil AI robot, the 8-Bit Guy went on a vacation.\u00a0 Unfortunately, something is wrong on Vacation Island.\u00a0 New evil enemies are on the island and the AI robot has taken over and is turning an island into a pollution power plant to fuel it's AI needs.\u00a0 Help 8-Bit Guy stop AI for good.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382910?t=1755110890","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382910?t=1755110890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382910/b2220f9e0a7b60655e3568ae0fa08ed4b90b3708/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755110890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382910/b2220f9e0a7b60655e3568ae0fa08ed4b90b3708/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755110890","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An 8-bit styled platform game.\u00a0 Running and Jumping sidescrolling, lots of powerups in an 8-bit world.\u00a0 30 levels with hidden items to collect.\u00a0 Each level has 3 hidden items to collect, a hoagie, a soda, and a French fries.\u00a0 There is also a magic door that leads to a secret room with coins.\u00a0 Collect each on every level to unlock the brickball game.\u00a0 Collect coins to buy power ups, like the wizard hat, turning you into a wizard that can float and shoot freezing ice that turns enemies into snowballs you can throw, or get the hammer and throw hammers at enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the keyboard or gamepad compatible .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:\u00a0 After defeating his boss and his evil AI robot, the 8-Bit Guy went on a vacation.\u00a0 Unfortunately, something is wrong on Vacation Island.\u00a0 New evil enemies are on the island and the AI robot has taken over and is turning an island into a pollution power plant to fuel it's AI needs.\u00a0 Help 8-Bit Guy stop AI for good.</p>","developers":["8-Bit Resurrection"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382910/fa8382752b881f60f75e1340e66821ec0ba57ea4/header.jpg?t=1755110890","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3382910/958482532/c57ff73d1314b96e5409f7274dbcb200fb6c347f/1754113772/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755110887","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3382910/958482532/c57ff73d1314b96e5409f7274dbcb200fb6c347f/1754113772/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755110887","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3382910/958482532/c57ff73d1314b96e5409f7274dbcb200fb6c347f/1754113772/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755110887","id":257177111,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177111/